---

### **8. PDF GENERATOR** (`src/lib/pdf-generator.ts` — first 30 lines)

**Current:**
```typescript
const BRAND = {
  indigo: [99, 102, 241],
  indigoLight: [238, 240, 255],
  // ... hardcoded colors
